{"name":"Courgette and spinach pasties","permalink":"courgette-spinach-pasties","edit":"https://github.com/The-Silverwood-Institute/Recibase/tree/master/src/main/scala/se/reciba/api/recibase/recipes/CourgetteSpinachPasties.scala","source":null,"description":null,"tagline":null,"notes":["We previously used goats cheese but feta is better at bringing out the courgette's flavour."],"dated_notes":[{"date":"2023-05-02","note":"Used less chilli"}],"tags":["Slow","Vegetarian","Stodge"],"inherited_tags":["Pescatarian","Vegetarian-ish"],"image":null,"ingredients_blocks":[{"name":null,"ingredients":[{"name":"Courgettes","quantity":"2","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Feta","quantity":"200g","prep":"diced","notes":null},{"name":"Spinach","quantity":"3 handfulls","prep":"roughly chopped","notes":null},{"name":"All Butter Puff Pastry","quantity":"320g","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Plain Flour","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":"to thicken mixture"},{"name":"Nutmeg","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Lemon Juice","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Salt","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Pepper","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null}]}],"method":["Grate the courgettes using a fine grater, then strain the result in a sieve.","Mix the grated courgette, feta, lemon juice, nutmeg and spinach in a pan on a low heat.","Bring to a very gentle simmer then turn off the heat.","Sift in a small amount of flour to thicken the mixure.","Leave the mixture to cool for a few minutes and lay out the pastry, cutting it into two pieces.","Place half the mixture on one side of each pastry, leaving at least a cm at the edges","Fold the other side of each pastry over the top of the mixture. Merge the edges of the pastry by pressing down with the tines of a fork.","Make a 2-3cm slice in the top of each pastry, to let out steam.","Bake in the oven at 220C/200C fan/gas 7 for 20 minutes."]}